{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"slug":[{"Plain":"端"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"端"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>作为极限</h3>\n<p>函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ 的<strong>端</strong>是以"},{"Local":{"url":"扭箭头范畴","text":"扭箭头范畴"}},{"Plain":"为指标的"},{"Local":{"url":"极限","text":"极限"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\int_{\\mathcal C} F = \\operatorname{lim}_{(X\\to Y)\\in\\mathsf{TwArr}(\\mathcal C)} F(X,Y).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>自然变换的集合</h3>\n<p>函子之间自然变换的集合可表示为端:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)}(F,G) = \\int_{X\\in\\mathcal C}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X),G(X)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>换言之,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)}(F,G) =\\operatorname{lim}_{(X\\to Y)\\in\\mathsf{TwArr}(\\mathcal C)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X),G(Y)).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}